guide forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe
title Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe
category Class
class Warlock
folder Warlock
levels 31-38
zone The Barrens
keywords In Search of Menara Voidrender, Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe, Fine Gold Thread, The Completed Robe, Menara Voidrender, Xizk Goodstitch, Robes of Arcana, Gold Bar, Hatefury Blood, Lesser Infernal Stone, Smoldering Coal, Warlock, class armor
reward item 6900
why A rare cloth robe for your 30s, which Menara Voidrender makes from the parts you bring her.

# The Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe: In Search of Menara Voidrender (4736-4739)
# from your trainer to Menara in Ratchet, then Components for the Enchanted
# Gold Bloodrobe (1796, 4781, 4782, 4783, 4784), Fine Gold Thread (4785) from
# Xizk Goodstitch in Booty Bay and The Completed Robe (4786).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json (Questie 12.1.0 and
# Questie-Forever) for the givers, drops and spawns; professions.json for
# Robes of Arcana (Tailoring) and Gold Bar (Mining, Smelt Gold); the
# classic quest data (quest 4786) for waiting while Menara
# finishes the robe; Forever's Warlock class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/): every quest of the chain
# unchanged in Forever.
# Robes of Arcana and a Gold Bar have no place to fetch them: tailors and
# miners make them, everyone else buys them at the Auction House. The Soul
# Shard is one of your own.
# Based on data, not play: the beta caps at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November, and the chain starts at 31, so it has not been checked in game.

step In Search of Menara Voidrender (Stormwind)
  only Human
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 31 Demisette Cloyce in the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet.
  level 31
  accept 4738                         -- Demisette Cloyce

step In Search of Menara Voidrender (Ironforge)
  only Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 31 Briarthorn in Ironforge sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet.
  level 31
  accept 4736                         -- Briarthorn

step In Search of Menara Voidrender (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 31 Zevrost in the Cleft of Shadow sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet.
  level 31
  accept 4737                         -- Zevrost

step In Search of Menara Voidrender (Undercity)
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip At 31 Kaal Soulreaper in the Magic Quarter sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet. The zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar.
  level 31
  accept 4739                         -- Kaal Soulreaper

step Menara Voidrender
  zone The Barrens
  tip Menara Voidrender stands in the tower on the hill above Ratchet, beside Strahad Farsan.
  turnin 4738 only Human              -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4736 only Gnome              -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4737 only Orc,Troll          -- Menara Voidrender
  turnin 4739 only Undead             -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 1796

step Robes of Arcana
  tip Bring Menara a Robes of Arcana: tailors sew it from a pattern that drops; otherwise buy one at the Auction House. Her next errand needs a Gold Bar: smelted from Gold Ore, or from the Auction House.
  turnin 1796                         -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 4781

step Xizk Goodstitch
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Xizk Goodstitch sells tailoring supplies in Booty Bay. Bring him the Gold Bar.
  turnin 4781                         -- Xizk Goodstitch
  accept 4782

step Back to Menara
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 4782                         -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 4783

step Desolace demons
  zone Desolace
  tip The Hatefury satyrs of Sargeron, in north-eastern Desolace, carry the blood; the Lesser Infernals of Mannoroc Coven, in the south, the stone.
  collect 6989 quest 4783.1           -- Vials of Hatefury Blood
  collect 6990 quest 4783.2           -- Lesser Infernal Stone

step Menara again
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 4783                         -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 4784

step Fine Gold Thread
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Xizk Goodstitch in Booty Bay has the thread for you.
  accept 4785                         -- Xizk Goodstitch
  turnin 4785

step Smoldering Coal
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The Burning Exiles, fire elementals in western Arathi Highlands, drop the coal.
  collect 6991 quest 4784.2           -- Smoldering Coal

step The Completed Robe
  zone The Barrens
  tip Back to Menara with the thread, the coal and a Soul Shard. Wait while she completes the robe, then speak to her again.
  turnin 4784                         -- Menara Voidrender
  accept 4786
  complete 4786                       -- Wait for the robe
  turnin 4786                         -- Menara Voidrender: Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe
